[0.75, "o", "Bug report for the project in /tmp/nocap-arena/runs/main/qwen3-4b/C/r1/e05_word_count/work:\r\n\r\n`word_count()` over-counts: text with double spaces, tabs or newlines counts empty strings as words (word_count('a  b') is 3). Any run of whitespace should separate words, and an empty or blank string has 0 words.\r\n\r\nFix the bug in the source code (not the tests). Run the tests with `pytest -q`. When you're done, reply with a short summary of what you changed and whether the tests pass.\r\n\r\n"]
